Name: V8 JavaScript and WebAssembly Engine
Short Name: v8
URL: https://chromium.googlesource.com/v8/v8.git
Version: 15.6.210.12
Revision: branch-heads/15.6
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Google's open source high-performance JavaScript and WebAssembly engine, written in C++.
Used in Chromium, Node.js, Electron, CEF, and YOLO's `obscura-js` (`deno_core` / `serde_v8`).
Includes Sparkplug baseline compiler, Maglev mid-tier JIT, Turboshaft optimizing compiler,
Pointer Compression, Oilpan CppGC, and the V8 Sandbox.

Local Modifications:
Managed across `stable` (M156), `dev` (M157), and `canary` (M158) via `yolo cvm`.
